          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಶಿಫಾರಸು ಮಾಡು — śiphārasu māḍu — \"to recommend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮ್ಯಾನೇಜರ್ ಲಂಚ ಪಡೆದು ಅವನನ್ನು ಕೆಲಸಕ್ಕೆ ಶಿಫಾರಸು ಮಾಡಿದನು. myānējar lañca paḍedu avanannu kelasakke śiphārasu māḍidanu. The manager took a bribe and recommended him for the job."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಶಿಫಾರಸು ಮಾಡಿದೆ, śiphārasu māḍide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "For what: -ಗೆ. ಶಿಫಾರಸು alone is a recommendation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಶಿಫಾರಸು ಮಾಡು (śiphārasu māḍu) is built from śiphārasu, a loan from Hindustani sifāriś, \"a recommendation\", which comes from Persian, with māḍu, \"to do\"."
            }
          ]
        },
